      "text": "Closest rival: immediate default bulk with identical registration choices. Trace bulk versus individual N2 at tick 0, then idle dispatch at tick 1. At boundary 2, bulk predicts a processed N1 duplicate and one total recognition; individual predicts N2 success and two. No ledger difference under these rules defeats the selective account; exceeding six actions or boundary 9 defeats a proposed completion."
