      ],
      "text": "Displaced work: dispatcher selects identities and boundaries, spending an action per request. Registrar retains six validations; server retains seven necessary first deliveries. Extra queued entries consume slots. Readable ledgers add no clerk labor. Builder must tabulate registrations, actions, eligibility, queue order and first recognitions."
