      ],
      "text": "Attack routine dependence on bulk acknowledgment of registered pending identities. Failed account: pending means uniformly outstanding recognition demand. N1 is already recognized but pending through boundary 3. Bulk at tick 0 queues N1 before N2, consuming tick 1 on a duplicate. This defeats that account, not every possible bulk schedule."
