      ],
      "text": "Surviving function: eight independently counted registrations and eight distinct sender recognitions. Preserve registration eligibility. Construction hypothesis for the fresh builder: individual N2 at tick 0 bypasses N1, then consider bulk after N1 clears at boundary 4. Removing bulk entirely needs seven new individual requests, exceeding six actions."
