      "text": "Six successful one-tick registrations and seven new recognitions remain. Empty initial queue prevents tick-0 delivery, leaving eight slots for seven first successes. Requests and registrations become eligible or complete next boundary; tick-8 requests cannot help. Six dispatcher actions, at most one per tick; roles cannot exchange. FIFO processes one entry per tick, including duplicates and failures. N8 delivery must occur at ticks 6-8. No added capacity, repairs, channels or timing changes are available."
